 "verdict": "The perturbation data is now ONE directed network: KO(X) -> the gene-products it measurably moves (the ends). That network is 100% real data. Reconstructing the ROUTE of each effect works for a validated MINORITY and is honestly flagged for the rest: 1% of strong effects are a DIRECT contact (PPI / curated causal / same complex; 6.5x chance), 14% are MEDIATED by a specific non-hub MEASURED stepping stone (another knockout in the data \u2014 43x a placebo), and 84% stay UNRESOLVED \u2014 distal/regulatory/diffuse, the far-field that does not compose. The confound that had to be controlled: pan-hub mediators (whose knockout moves everything) are excluded, and PPI/pathway structure is used only to name the direct entry point \u2014 as a mediator filter it just re-selects hubs and does not help. So the honest product is a real measured influence network with a per-effect route: direct, measured-mediated, or explicitly unresolved.",
